{"id":"e90069cabe220da2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-l-definable-set.md","title":"ZFC L Definable Set","display":"df-zfc-l-definable-set — ZFC L Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-l-definable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-l-definable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-l-definable-set — ZFC L Definable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-l-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-l-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-l-definable-set — ZFC L Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfa29222af6471b2\" href=\"?note=cfa29222af6471b2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md\">../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71230ab1646b476d\" href=\"?note=71230ab1646b476d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset\">58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\">\\(L_\\bullet\\)</span> is a constructible hierarchy and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\">\\(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cfa29222af6471b2\" href=\"?note=cfa29222af6471b2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md\">../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S\\)</span> is definability over a membership structure (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"71230ab1646b476d\" href=\"?note=71230ab1646b476d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset\">58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LDefinableSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LDefinableSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{LDefinableSet}_S(x,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S(L_\\bullet(\\alpha),x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{LDefinableSet}_S(x,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S(L_\\bullet(\\alpha),x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa29222af6471b2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset","status":"resolved","id":"71230ab1646b476d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa29222af6471b2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_\\bullet$ is a constructible hierarchy and $\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the ordinal predicate (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner4-definable-subset","status":"resolved","id":"71230ab1646b476d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypot